{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993367404640001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"spiny-ferry-ripen","assignee":"Joe Oakhart","author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":6},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Root cause: _cmd_list (reads_cli.py) validated --sort/--priority/--min-children but NOT --status; an unknown value fell through apply_ticket_filters' set-membership match -> [] with exit 0. FIX (committed bbddfc0c5): added _VALID_LIST_STATUSES + a validation block returning exit 2 naming the bad value + valid set; documented the vocabulary in list --help (goldens synced). RED->GREEN: tests/unit/test_list_status_validation.py (5 invalid cases exit-0 RED -> exit-2 GREEN; 7 valid cases pass). Pending: land via Gerrit + close.","timestamp":1783274100515993001}],"created_at":1783105223495646001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"bae450b5-1f64-4419-b395-44c504d0d656","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3006-e198-13db-4e1f"}],"description":"## Summary\n`rebar list --status=all` (or any invalid status value) silently returns an empty list instead of rejecting the value. An unrecognized filter value should be a loud error, not an empty result set.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. Run `rebar list --status=all` (all is not a valid status).\n2. Observe: exit 0, output `[]`.\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n- Expected: non-zero exit + error naming the invalid status value and listing valid ones (open/in_progress/closed/blocked/deleted...).\n- Actual: exit 0 with [] — indistinguishable from 'no tickets match'.\n\n## Impact\nCorrupted a real measurement during the 3006-e198 derisk experiments (an agent computed 614 false class-A drift candidates from the silently-empty list). Any agent or script filtering by a mistyped status silently operates on an empty world.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] An invalid --status value exits non-zero with an error listing valid statuses.\n- [ ] A test covers the invalid-status path (RED before fix).\n- [ ] Valid statuses (and any 'all'-equivalent, if one is intended) are documented in `rebar list --help`.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"fbe97bed-bbc3-4d01-b858-ea5a4777446d","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"2dce-d7b9-6574-4f62","ticket_type":"bug","title":"rebar list --status=<invalid> silently returns empty instead of erroring","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["2ab83683-9fd1-4464-9764-a43ffbf353ce","bae450b5-1f64-4419-b395-44c504d0d656","fbe97bed-bbc3-4d01-b858-ea5a4777446d","18c707ca-3f77-4a64-aa13-0c3dc00a4a99","278a5d29-537a-4765-ae35-e604c056e347","e2f78493-ee30-4f5d-a896-401d2e56249a"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993367404640001,"uuid":"efb26845-baa2-4fa9-997c-e734e0bd9dbc"}